# Normalise line endings: the tree is edited from Windows and from a Linux sandbox.
* text=auto
# The tool writes LF; with core.autocrlf the checkout wrote CRLF, so every tool write
# flipped a whole file's line endings and git warned on each one. One ending, everywhere.
*.csv text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.STEP binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
